      "timestamp_raw": "Apr 22, 2013 22:20:07 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "Here's yet another clone of S. flava var. rubricorpora from Liberty Co, FL.  This plant is very similar to its relatives, clones A, B, G, T, and so on.  The body on this one turns solid red once fully developed, and it has that typical contrasting greenish yellow lid.  Shape on this one is pretty decent too.  It's hard to come by a solid red bodied rubricorpora that doesn't look good!<br/><br/>S. flava var. rubricorpora clone C Liberty Co, FL.  Photos taken Mid April, 2013, and the traps are about a week old from opening.  The color will become more intense in the next few weeks:<br/><a href=\"http://s1110.photobucket.com/user/meizzwang/media/Apr%202013/IMG_0167_zpsf973efed.jpg.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/Apr%202013/IMG_0167_zpsf973efed.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"http://s1110.photobucket.com/user/meizzwang/media/Apr%202013/IMG_0169_zps7bb3e39c.jpg.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/Apr%202013/IMG_0169_zps7bb3e39c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><br/>Photos below are of the exact same clone, but in a different pot:<br/><a href=\"http://s1110.photobucket.com/user/meizzwang/media/Apr%202013/IMG_0148_zps32815302.jpg.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/Apr%202013/IMG_0148_zps32815302.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"http://s1110.photobucket.com/user/meizzwang/media/Apr%202013/IMG_0147_zps24606010.jpg.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/Apr%202013/IMG_0147_zps24606010.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"http://s1110.photobucket.com/user/meizzwang/media/Apr%202013/IMG_0145_zps6f1c841a.jpg.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meiz